lid red background.\nThe Peel-Back: The skin seamlessly strips away to expose realistic, glowing white or transparent bones (the ribcage, spine, and skull).\nThe Core Reveal: Internal organs—most notably a pulsing heart or floating lungs—are shown clearly within the frame.\nThe React/Beat: The internal anatomy briefly moves, throbs, or reacts to a dramatic audio beat drop.\nThe Return: The animation snaps smoothly back to the finished, fully-clothed character. [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]\n\nPopular edits include characters from Demon Slayer (Tanjiro), Dr. STONE (Senku), and gaming avatars like Minecraft's Groxmc. [1, 2]\n\nHow Creators Are Making It\n\nWhile traditional hand-drawn animators participate by manually sketching the joints and organ layers, the vast majority of viral clips are generated using AI art tools and video templates. [1, 2, 3, 4]\n\nCapCut Templates: Beginners use CapCut templates directly on TikTok. Creators simply upload a standard character photo, and the built-in filter overlays the glowing neon skeleton and internal organ effects automatically. [1, 2, 3]\nAI Image Generators: Digital artists feed character silhouettes into AI platforms with precise prompts to generate the layered look—instructing the AI to isolate the ribcage, skull, and spine while preserving the exact pose, clothing lines, and crimson background.\n\nFast breakdown, fast roast, zero brain cells wasted. ✌️\nMore speedruns coming soon. 🔥\n\nHit the like button if you enjoyed the video ( 👍)\nSubscribe and turn on notifications (🔔)\n\nThis is an original commentary video made by NO FACE.\n\nI script, voice, and edit everything, and I use short contextual clips only to illustrate the topic.\n\nEach clip is transformed through my narration, pacing, visual edits, sound design, and storyline so the final video delivers new insight, meaning, and entertainment value.\n\nAll outside clips belong to their respective creators and are used under fair use for commentary, criticism, and storytelling.\n\n█░█ ▄▀█ █▀ █░█ ▀█▀ ▄▀█ █▀▀\n█▀█ █▀█ ▄█ █▀█ ░█░ █▀█ █▄█\n\n#animationmeme #memes #shorts #animationvideo #animation", "hashtags": ["#animationmeme", "#memes", "#shorts", "#animationvideo", "#animation"], "music": {"title": "original sound", "author": "NO FACE", "play_url": "https://v16-webapp-prime.us.tiktok.com/video/tos/alisg/tos-alisg-v-27dcd7/oQoP5u9xDYp3s5yeJbFOApme8FfDpfGQEKAlQ3/?a=1988&bti=ODszNWYuMDE6&&bt=125&ft=GcAInInz7ThNTDZGXq8Zmo&mime_type=audio_mpeg&rc=ZTw7NTo6Omg3ZjU5OTo4PEBpM3h4ZnM5cnF1PDMzODU8NEBgLmAxL2FjX2AxYjE2Ly9hYSNfb2hgMmRra29hLS1kMS1zcw%3D%3D&expire=1788292040&l=202609011346494633CFD3CF32781CD0A1&ply_type=3&policy=3&signature=cacffc0eaa8f2e4f957d0856937bbfe3&tk=0&btag=e000c8000"}, "media_url": "", "text": "", "text_source": "none", "provider": "apify", "region": "GLOBAL", "region_source": "", "captured_at": "2026-09-01T13:47:27+00:00", "cluster": "", "trend_slug": "demon-slayer"}, {"video_id": "7670312736814845192", "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@maderezs/video/7670312736814845192", "author": "@maderezs", "views": 3500000.0, "likes": 1000000.0, "comments": 3996.0, "reposts": 62200.0, "description": "the character best suited to this trend #demonslayer #muichiro #anime #animeedit", "hashtags": ["#demonslayer", "#muichiro", "#anime", "#animeedit"], "music": {"title": "оригинальный звук - maderezs", "author": "maderezs", "play_url": "https://v16-webapp-prime.tiktok.com/video/tos/alisg/tos-alisg-v-27dcd7/okZvBQfDQIgDJBqUKq1P1cfm0BwCTEzPFDmYMg/?a=1988&bti=ODszNWYuMDE6&&bt=125&ft=GNDpcInz7Th.FfZGXq8Zmo&mime_type=audio_mpeg&rc=aTdmNzM2O2VlZWkzN2loNkBpankzb2o5cnA5PDMzODU8NEAxM2IwY2JfNWExNi81LWMtYSM0LnEvMmQ0bW1hLS1kMS1zcw%3D%3D&expire=1788197393&l=202608311629386E52F63BED46C9024B7D&ply_type=3&policy=3&signature=05e58c324218bfe071429a5217caf730&tk=0&btag=e00078000"}, "media_url": "", "text": "", "text_source": "none", "provider": "apify", "region": "GLOBAL", "region_source": "", "captured_at": "2026-08-31T16:29:40+00:00", "cluster": "", "trend